ORDERS ["Take Tinker's Plating now.","Defend the claim and prospector; intercept active enemies before chasing distant seams.","Pan the nearest safe active seam between waves until 40 gold.","Build the first sluice beside the river without blocking center-ford; build all three sluices as gold permits.","Build an assay office near the claim after the first sluice.","Fortify the claim with palisades while keeping the center-ford and hero routes open.","Build sentry beacons around the claim and center-ford, spacing their slow fields to cover approaches from all four spawn edges.","Build turrets behind palisades with clear lines of sight; prioritize west, then the edge named by the current threat.","Upgrade defenses before adding stockpiles; add one stockpile only when near the gold cap.","Repair or replace breached palisades and wrecked defenses between waves.","Before wave 20, complete four turrets, six sentry beacons, layered palisades, and keep enough gold for emergency rebuilding.","At wave 20, focus all fire on the Baron's Rocket Cart, clear nearby wreckers and escorts only when they block attacks, and keep moving during each three-rocket volley."]
