ORDERS ["Hold wave 3 with the rig; do not build until 40g.","At 40g, BUILD a sluice beside the river near the center ford.","Then BUILD a sentry_beacon covering the center ford and claim approach.","BUILD palisades at the ford to funnel attackers through the beacon field; keep one passable firing lane.","BUILD a turret behind the ford palisades with line of sight across the crossing.","Add a second sluice, then a stockpile before gold reaches the pan cap.","Expand to four turrets and three sentry_beacons by wave 15, covering the ford, claim, and weakest spawn approaches.","BUILD the assay_office after the first two turrets are secure.","From wave 18 onward, reserve repair and replacement gold; focus all fire on the Baron's Rocket Cart at wave 20."]
