ORDERS ["Take Long-Barrel Resonator now.","Defend the claim from the active west attack; use the rig blast whenever enemies cluster.","Between attacks, mine gold-seam-2, then gold-seam-3, while staying close enough to intercept threats at the claim.","At 25 gold, build a sentry_beacon near the claim covering the center ford and western approach.","At 50 gold, build a turret beside the beacon with line of sight across the ford.","Add palisades at the ford and west approach without blocking turret fire.","Prioritize thieves, then wreckers, then the nearest enemy threatening the claim.","Save toward a second turret and sentry_beacon before wave 20; concentrate defenses around the Rocket Cart's approach.","Do not build a sluice, stockpile, or assay_office until the first beacon and turret are standing."]
